  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BARBADOS SHOREBIRD RESERVES - WOODBOURNE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Maintain Woodbourne Shorebird Refuge, established in 2009, on Barbados, as a no-shooting refugium for migrant shorebirds and waterbirds. The caretaker of the refuge will also serve as a liaison to maintain communication and collaboration with active shooting swamps on the island. Birds Caribbean and shareholders of Fosters Swamp will maintain the wetland as a no-shooting reserve for fall migrating shorebirds.</narrative>
  </description>
